WEBVTT

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.520
I can't believe you did that for me.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.530
Nobody asked you. Asshole.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.610
I'm through with owing 
anybody anything, got it?

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.490
So once you're out of here, we're even!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.470
It's over...

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:53.230
I knew you were alive, Chainsaw!

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.830
Yeow!

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.140
All better!

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.370
This is pointless, Chainsaw!

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.720
The pain!

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.340
It hurts!

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.120
You won't find my heart in here!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.390
You can't kill me!

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.810
A devil?!

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:29.810
This bodes ill.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.860
Denji's losing blood ceaselessly.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.200
When he's lost too much, 
his chainsaws will retract.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.200
You are so much weaker now.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.140
How far you have fallen, Chainsaw?!

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.670
My chainsaws are in?

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.480
Need more blood!

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.150
You've failed!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.080
Die!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.600
Chainsaw!

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.750
This blood might seriously taste like shit...

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:55.750
But watching you shriek in pain...

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.420
Makes it sweet like strawberry jam!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.680
<i>The hunters that devils fear...</i>

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.430
are the ones with a couple of screws loose.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.690
Sahara had his head on straight...

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.440
So he died.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:26.070
Same goes for Kinouchi, 
and Subaru, and Sasaki. All sane.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.900
They were reasonable enough 
to fear attacks from a devil,

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.750
and that fear made the devils stronger.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.840
You been working with Aki for a while now.
 What do you think about him?

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.130
Is his head on straight?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:44.840
I wouldn't say that about anyone 
who's trying to kill the Gun Devil.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:49.600
Didn't you join Public Safety because
 you were after the Gun Devil, too?

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.970
You got any screws loose?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.230
No, sir.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.930
Exactly.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:02.740
Most hunters, including you, 
are out to put the Gun Devil down.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.800
They're earnest. Honest. Straightforward.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.540
And that means the devils know 
exactly how to fuck with them.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:15.250
But there's no telling what 
a crazy person's thinking.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.890
And even devils are afraid 
of what they don't understand.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.900
You're drinking too much again, master.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.040
See, that's being sensible again.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.010
Can't be unhinged without 
loosening the screws a bit every day.

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:37.710
And if you're still visiting your 
partners' graves every month,

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.280
then yours are still pretty tight.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.940
I'm heading home.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.150
Aki's still a punk, so make 
sure to work him over.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.530
I'll take it one step at a time.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.780
Not good enough.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:54.030
The kid's serious about 
collecting the meat chunks, right?

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:57.130
He's gonna actually find 
the Gun Devil if he does.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.560
No...

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.890
No, no, no, no, no, no—

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:19.900
No.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:24.750
Aki, you wanna join 
the private sector with me?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.630
I received a pretty generous offer!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.130
Instead of chasing the Gun,

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:36.060
we could go out for lunch, 
see a movie on the way home,

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.930
and really enjoy ourselves.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.790
If you wanna go out 
for drinks, I'll join you.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.800
But I have no intention 
of ever going private.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.970
And I'll take your almond tofu.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.800
Then hand me a cigarette in exchange.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:02.810
<i>If Aki fights the Gun Devil, he's gonna die.</i>

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.680
<i>Not because we're too weak,</i>

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:10.140
<i>or because it's the kind of devil that 
can kill hundreds of people in seconds.</i>

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:16.150
<i>It's because Aki's cool, 
and serious, and kind...</i>

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.180
<i>and normal, like most people.</i>

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:21.600
<i>But...</i>

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.750
Take that!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.820
Ow, ow!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.530
It...

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:35.680
It's over.

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.600
<i>But him?</i>

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.360
Eureka, dude.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:50.130
I cut you up, and you bleed.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:53.320
I drink that blood and heal!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.910
I'm a fucking perpetual motion machine!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:02.590
That Nobel Prize is mine!

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.750
<i>I've never seen anyone crazier than him,</i>

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:12.010
<i>so maybe he can kill the Gun Devil!</i>

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.710
Pain...

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.440
Ow, ow...

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:35.780
It hurts...

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.580
You still alive, Aki?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.860
How long...

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.540
How long has it been?

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:52.670
About three days since 
you got stabbed, I think?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.930
Meowy...

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.440
Let's all go out for drinks.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:02.680
Since it's over... I'm gonna sleep a bit.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.290
It's over?

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.940
This is my weakness...

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.320
It's my heart.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.130
Please kill me.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.190
I'm sorry.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.160
I apologize.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.070
It <i>hurts</i>...

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.600
What, already?!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:22.080
I was still having fun! 
It was like being in a pool!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>AUTOMATED</b>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>AUTOMATED</b>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>DOORS</b>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>DOORS</b>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>PLEASE</b>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>PLEASE</b>

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:34.630
We're out.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:41.770
Got a piece of the Gun Devil's flesh,
 the sky is clear...

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.270
And I'm feeling good, 
like I just took a huge shit.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.460
It's like I'm floating...

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.460
Whoa there.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.650
He's out...

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.400
Makes sense, considering he was fighting 
the devil the whole time without sleeping.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.660
We'll get Aki and Denji to a hospital.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.140
You two head back 
to the office and check in.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.780
A welcoming party?

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:15.720
Yep.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:18.540
Since the full Division 4 
is finally assembled,

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.310
we ought to get to know each other better,

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:23.450
and deal with some of our outstanding issues.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.580
What issues?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:29.810
Well, the thing is, Kobeni and Arai 
are talking about quitting Public Safety.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.480
Not only are they afraid of the devils,

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.320
they feel pretty guilty 
about trying to kill Denji, too.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:38.700
You tried to kill him, too.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.890
I know, right?!

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:43.230
Kids these days! They're so sensitive.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.200
Would it kill them to be a little bolder?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.380
Over drinks, they'll be able to 
apologize to Denji easily,

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.720
and we'll be able to 
convince them to not quit.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.250
You're just in this for drinks.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.760
It wasn't much, but I found 
a chunk of its flesh.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.250
If we're doing this, 
it needs to be this week.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.850
Why's that?

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:07.070
If we're having a drinking party, 
I want to invite Ms. Makima.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.050
She's going on a business trip 
to Kyoto next week.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:21.240
With so many devils targeting Denji, 
she's looking into getting reinforcements.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.380
So the party needs to be this week.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.740
Be honest with me.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.370
What do you think Denji <i>is</i>?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:35.770
That devil seemed to know about him,

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.880
and I've never seen anything 
like what he turned into.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:42.630
But the biggest mystery is how much 
Ms. Makima seems to be interested in him.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:48.730
She used to travel all the time, 
but she's stuck to Tokyo lately,

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.560
and that's probably because of Denji.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:54.270
Does she know his secret?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.280
Wanna get her hammered and ask about it?

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:04.280
Cheers!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.040
Man, all this stuff smells awesome!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:10.660
This is enough food for a lifetime!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.570
That's the stuff!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.210
Oh, here we go.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.770
This is nuts!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.770
Here's your plate.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:20.900
Where do I even start? 
It all smells great.

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:24.060
This is good. It's been six months 
since I last had anything to drink.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.600
I only drink a bit at home, too.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.170
Away with you!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.970
The sashimi shall all be mine!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.480
What even is this? Looks tasty!

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:37.230
Sorry... I got a little lost.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.110
Kobe, Kobe! Right over here!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.240
Ms. Makima says she'll be late.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.630
Three parfaits.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.650
And then...

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.370
Three shiratama dumpling trays.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:53.170
I've never had anything this good before.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.330
You send most of your pay home, right?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.400
Be sure to eat your fill.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.840
Hands off, you scoundrel!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.130
The fried chicken is all mine!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.850
You didn't bring your Fiend, Fushi?

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.650
They're a little too scary 
for a place like this.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:11.520
I envy how reasonable yours is, Hayakawa.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:12.520
Hey!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.340
You're young, so order 
whatever you want! And eat up!

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:18.550
Damn it! I can't read most of these kanji...

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:20.270
m 225 15 l 225 48 422 48 422 15

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:20.270
<b>Kisu Tempura</b>

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:25.460
So... about that kiss...

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.770
I'm too bashful to do it right now.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:32.540
Let me drink a bit more first.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.700
I'll make it a juicy one, too.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:41.420
So will you forgive us 
for trying to kill you?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.390
Dude, all is forgiven! Super forgiven!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:48.900
This is a welcoming party for the rookies, 
so stand up and introduce yourselves!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.140
Your name, age, and the devil 
you're contracted with!

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:55.620
Don't reveal your devil contract in public.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:59.240
You shouldn't share that 
with anyone you don't trust.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.810
Man, you never loosen up, do you?

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:05.070
Aw, it's fine! It's probably fine.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.470
I wanna know hobbies, too.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.450
They tell you a lot about a person.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.270
I'm Denji. I'm 16, if I remember right.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:16.450
My hobbies are eating and sleeping!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.580
Yikes, that is <i>young</i>.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.680
You didn't drink, did you?!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:22.460
Just tea.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:26.000
I'm Hirokazu Arai! I'm 22 years old!

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.960
I've got a contract with the Fox Devil!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.590
My hobby is writing haiku!

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:32.720
That's the same devil as Hayakaptain.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.960
The Fox Devil is friendly toward humans.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.360
She's got contracts with a lot of hunters.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.530
But she only lets hot ones call on her head!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.730
As devils go, she's down bad.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.210
I'm Kobeni Higashiyama.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:48.480
I'm 20...

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.710
I've got a devil contract... 
but it's a secret.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:54.670
My hobby is eating tasty things.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.720
Isn't her outfit cute?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.370
Yeah.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.870
It's a hand-me-down from my sister.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:03.630
Kobeni has eight sisters. Isn't that crazy?

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.630
Hey, where's your rookie, Fushi?

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.630
I'm sad to report that they 
were killed yesterday.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.360
Rest in peace!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:14.010
They will be... mist... pissed... missed?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.890
Already wasted, huh?

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.230
Do people really die that often?

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.520
Public Safety handles the devils 
too tough for the private sector.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.170
Yeah, we're always dropping like flies.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.900
No one who joined up at the 
same time as me is still alive.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:33.160
Denji's not gonna die, 
cuz he wants a smooch!

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.900
Himeno gets really <i>friendly</i> 
when she's drunk.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:42.790
I'm pretty sure she's kissed everyone here,
 apart from the rookies.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.670
There's no escaping her.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.800
<i>That's a guaranteed kiss!</i>

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.260
Today's the day... of my first kiss.

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:56.550
What kiss?

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:59.460
Ms. Makima!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:02.390
Excuse me, I'd like a draft beer.

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:05.200
Have a seat, Ms. Makima.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.280
I've never seen her in person before.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.660
So, are you kissing someone, Denji?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.900
No, ma'am!

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:19.040
Aw, are we not gonna kiss, Denji?!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.570
We are!

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:26.040
Excuse me. Another beer.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:30.010
So, what's this about kisses?

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:33.930
<i>I don't want Ms. Makima 
to see me kiss Himeno.</i>

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.090
No smoochies?

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:40.060
<i>But I want a kiss with tongue 
just as bad!</i>

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.060
<i>I've gotta try and change the subject!</i>

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:47.990
Ms. Makima! Y'know, I got one 
of them Gun Devil thingies!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.320
Yes, I heard. That's very impressive, Denji.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:56.730
We've never seen devils appearing with 
Gun Devil flesh this frequently before.

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.420
Given how the most recent one 
was targeting Denji,

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:02.080
something must be going on.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:06.180
Do you know what Denji's deal is, ma'am?

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:09.340
Relinquish that!

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:12.590
That, too, is mine!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.100
I'll tell you if you can outdrink me.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.350
Two more beers, please.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:28.230
I want in on that! Make it three!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.360
Horse sashimi! Fried chicken! 
And more horse sashimi!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.820
Fried chicken!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:38.780
That's mine, too.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.330
Another beer, if you would.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.880
You're pretty impressive, Power.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.660
There aren't a lot of Fiends 
who can control their urge to kill.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.340
A feat of my advanced IQ!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:55.360
Is IQ part of it? How high is yours, then?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.720
Um... 100?

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.630
Is that high?

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.500
I think my score was around 100, too.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.970
Then it was 120.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.950
If I remember right, Fushi's is high.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.710
Specifically, 134.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.640
Wow, must be proud enough
to actually remember it.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.880
If I recall, mine was 500?

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:14.860
Perhaps 1000?

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:20.870
Oh my.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.750
<i>She's watching!</i>

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.120
<i>Ms. Makima's watching.</i>

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:29.700
<i>But what is this?</i>

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.420
The kiss is afoot!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.500
<i>Is that a tongue I feel?</i>

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.090
<i>Feels good... soft! Really soft!</i>

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.010
<i>What the hell?! It's her tongue...</i>

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.070
<i>But it's melting in my mouth?!</i>

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.880
<i>That's... not... a tongue!</i>

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.890
<i>It's puke!</i>

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.640
Well, that's traumatic.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.060
Uh-oh...

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.650
Excuse me, can we get 
something to wipe this up?

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:53.600
Oh, this isn't good! Not good at all!

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:59.530
Denji will swallow anything 
remotely nutritious!

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:05.990
Pochita!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:08.250
I found something edible!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.380
Check it out, Pochita!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:22.520
Those rats are chowing on some drunk's puke!

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.140
Eating puke! What a joke!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.770
What kinda mammals are they?!

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:36.020
Unbelievable... Himeno has 
absolutely no restraint.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.090
My method for throwing up 
works pretty well, right?

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.540
I used to look after my mom when 
she came home drunk from work.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:50.740
Not that it makes me as good 
a Devil Hunter as you.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.790
I'm pretty jealous.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.290
Jealous?!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.780
Dude... My first kiss tasted like barf!

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:02.680
And you're jealous?!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:15.070
I'll see Hayakawa and his household home.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.070
You wanna drop by somewhere else?

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:16.860
I drank a lot...

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.310
Arai, look after Himeno.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:21.440
Ms. Makima paid the tab tonight, 
everyone, so show your gratitude.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:25.090
Nothing tastes better than 
drinks someone else paid for.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:25.820
Yep.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:30.700
Huh? Where's Denji?

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:35.080
I saw Himeno pick him up 
and walk off somewhere.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.840
<i>It's dark... So dark...</i>

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.550
<i>Where the hell am I?</i>

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:48.590
<i>Water... Water... Water...</i>

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:53.940
<i>Come to think of it, the puke 
girl gave me a barf kiss.</i>

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:58.970
<i>Damn it! Water, water...</i>

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.460
Huh... It's Den-Den-Denji?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:23.100
What are you doing in my place?

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:27.670
Did I bring you here?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.010
Huh?

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:33.990
I'm so dizzy... What the hell?

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:42.070
Y'know, I noticed you're 
head over heels for Makima.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.570
My head's spinning...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:50.460
You could do better than 
that bitch, seriously.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:56.250
You and Aki, fawning all over her! Ugh...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:57.570
Seriously!

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:58.640
Moo-ve on!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:24.290
Wanna do it?

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:48.800
m 199 189 l 326 189 326 231 199 231

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:48.800
<b>Sorry...
I got a little lost.</b>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:46.300
<b>This is good. 
It's been too long.</b>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:46.460
m 407 124 l 490 124 490 149 407 149

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:46.800
<b>I don't drink
much at home, too.</b>

